                <head>Multilateral agreement respecting North Atlantic weather stations</head>
                <p>[Agreement opened for signature at London May 12–June 30, 1949; instrument of
                    acceptance by the United States deposited August 23, 1949; entered into force
                    January 13, 1950. For text, see <hi rendition="#italic">United States Treaties
                        and Other International Agreements</hi> (UST), volume 1, page 356.]</p>
            </div>
